== UNVERIFIED values (ratchet: must not grow)
UNVERIFIED GPIO_PIN_PREFIX: gpio_find maps physical pin -> BCM via GPIO_PIN_MAP, but the pin table is third-party (see pinmap.conf), the gpiochip/line names on a real Pi 4 are unchecked (HW), and gs.conf pin values reach gpio_find only after the M3c wiring
UNVERIFIED DTBO_DIR_LOWER: overlayroot on Pi is untested: the lower-layer path of a separate FAT mount is not known; value is the plain directory
UNVERIFIED GADGET_IFNAME: placeholder: this profile has no gadget NIC; the name rpi0 was chosen, not read from anywhere
UNVERIFIED CONSOLE_TTY: HW: /dev/serial0 exists on Pi 4 only with enable_uart=1 in config.txt, which no image sets yet; gs-init.sh runs under set -e, tee to a missing node would fail
UNVERIFIED PART_OVERLAY_NUM: design for the M6 spike: no image with this layout was built, overlayroot on Pi OS is untested
UNVERIFIED PART_VIDEOS_NUM: design for the M6 spike: gs-init.sh parted mkpart videos has no logical/extended handling, untested
UNVERIFIED THERMAL_CPU_TEMP_FILE: HW: the zone index 0 is not read from a source; check `cat /sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone*/type`
UNVERIFIED RTC_I2C_BUS: HW: /dev/i2c-1 for the ARM i2c1 is the common name but the number is not read from a source; check `ls /dev/i2c-*`
